   <p><persName ref="cwgk:N00021125">John, W, Sulivan</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021126">John B Burton</persName> 
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021127">S A Vance</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021128">John, F, May</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021119">Meredith F. Mcgehee</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021129">Cornelius Moseley</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021117">Mansfield Martin</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021130">Samuel, B, Lashbrook</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021131">A, G, Yewell</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021132">T. F. Cundiff</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021133">B H Davis</persName>
<lb/><persName ref="cwgk:N00021118">Linsey Pursell</persName></p>
<p>The Above is the List of the Jurors. that <unclear>tried</unclear><persName ref="cwgk:N00020738">Stephen Duvall</persName> signed by themselves and who Dircted me to attach the Same to his petition thus Was gotten up to Reduce the punishmt to Confiment for Life in the <orgName ref="cwgk:O00000266">pententary</orgName></p>
<p><persName ref="cwgk:N00002679">Thomas Shackelford</persName>, D, S</p>
